# Row I2.2: a seat by state. The door's staff half (C3), on Mateo's design round (Hugo leads, nobody on the panel): the
# lead reads who is waiting and answers; an interviewer with no seat gets not-found; the recruiter and the hiring
# manager hold no ConductInterview, so the role gate answers 403 (reported against the standing 404 rule); the tenant
# gate stops a guest (its own interview's or another's), a caller with no session and a Work-only person (403).
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.mateoDesign}/waiting | recruiter=403 hiringManager=403 interviewer2 guest=403 guest:aikoCoding=403 anon=403 workOnly=403 | interviewer
POST /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.mateoDesign}/admit | recruiter=403 hiringManager=403 interviewer2 guest=403 anon=403 workOnly=403 | interviewer | {"admit":false}
# The guest's realtime token: the guest's own, never a staff session's (they have their own bridge).
GET /api/interview-invite/realtime-token | anon recruiter interviewer | guest
